@startuml r-01-phase-map
title PortCloak — Rollout phase map

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "Helvetica"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #8A8D90
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  FontColor #151515
}
skinparam ArrowColor #0066CC

rectangle "**P0 — Shell & foundations**\nWails shell · ~/.portcloak · keychain\nredacting logger" as P0 #E7F1FA
rectangle "**P1 — Configuration**\nEnvironments · Storage · Probe\na Test that tells you the truth" as P1 #E7F1FA
rectangle "**P2 — Local capture**\nkc.sh export · manifest · packager\ndisk store · first vertical slice" as P2 #DEF3D9
rectangle "**P3 — Remote targets**\nSSH · Docker · Kubernetes\nephemeral clones · SFTP" as P3 #FDF2CF
rectangle "**P4 — Resilience**\nretry · breaker · checkpoints\nresume across restarts" as P4 #FDF2CF
rectangle "**P5 — Storage & encryption**\nS3 · Azure Blob\nopt-in age encryption" as P5 #DEF3D9
rectangle "**P6 — Inspection**\ntiered open · SQLite index\nsearch · ledger · audited reveal" as P6 #DEF3D9
rectangle "**P7 — Restore**\npreconditions · dry run · strategies\nimport · validation" as P7 #DEF3D9
rectangle "**P8 — Verification & deps**\nunmasked-secret proof\nthemes and provider JARs" as P8 #E7F1FA
rectangle "**Release 0.0.1**\ngate · signed artifacts · tag" as R #F0F0F0

P0 --> P1
P1 --> P2
P2 --> P3
P3 --> P4
P4 --> P5
P5 --> P6
P6 --> P7
P7 --> P8
P8 --> R

note right of P2
  First point at which the tool
  produces something real:
  a sealed, verifiable bundle.
end note

note right of P3
  Highest risk in the plan.
  Teardown and label stripping are
  built **before** anything can
  create a clone.
end note

note right of P4
  A deliberate retrofit. The Doer
  seam only has the right shape once
  real call sites exist to wrap.
end note

note right of P7
  The loop closes. Fidelity stops
  being a claim about a file and
  becomes a realm people log in to.
end note

@enduml
